SUBMISSION/FIGURES/DATA AND SCRIPTS/FIG*.svg
SUBMISSION/FIGURES/DATA AND SCRIPTS/FIG*.pdf
SUBMISSION/FIGURES/DATA AND SCRIPTS/FIG*.png
SIMULATIONS/hyperparameter_figures/
SIMULATIONS/*.svg
SIMULATIONS/*.pdf
SIMULATIONS/*.png

# working material that is not part of the published repository
NOT FOR SUBMISSION/

# lock files of Microsoft Office
~$*

